SQLarius: Welcome. In this lesson, we’ll focus on searching through categories.
MainCharacter: ...
[signal arg="inFrame"]

SQLarius: This is the input field. Type a category here to look up items stored in the database.
[signal arg="T2_Start"]

SQLarius: Here you can see the SQL query that the system builds from your input. It shows exactly what the database receives.
[signal arg="T2_Backend"]

SQLarius: And here is the output panel. Whatever the database returns will appear in this section.
[signal arg="T2_NormalSearch"]

SQLarius: Try entering a normal category, such as “phones.” This will show you how the system behaves with regular input.
[signal arg="T2_Done"]
